Description: Opt-in VTE with OSC 52 clipboard support
 VTE with OSC 52 clipboard support, installed privately under
 /opt/vte-osc52. Use vte-osc52-run to opt individual applications into
 its libraries and typelibs. System VTE is not replaced.
